{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1985 - Following a sudden shift in Soviet leadership, the USSR abandoned d\u00e9tente and launched a full-scale invasion of Western Europe. West Germany fell within days, and most of the German Air Force was wiped out on the ground. Only a handful of squadrons managed to escape to Britain, regrouping for NATO\u2019s last stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Central Europe in flames, the Soviet war machine turned north. The Soviets goal: control of Scandinavia and the North Atlantic, cutting off NATO\u2019s supply lines and forcing the West into submission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a desperate bid to halt the advance, NATO formed the Task Force Northern Defenders\u2014a coalition of land, sea, and air units drawn from across the alliance. Among them, the remnants of the German Luftwaffe, hastily reformed and thrown into the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an F-4 Phantom pilot, you will engage in high-risk missions\u2014from air superiority to deep strikes and close air support\u2014fighting to hold the line and push the Soviets back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outnumbered. Outgunned. Not defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fate of Europe is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive &quot;Cold War Gone Hot&quot; Scenario Set in the icy landscapes of Northern Scandinavia during a fictional conflict in 1985.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">13 Engaging and Varied Missions A wide range of taskings including CAP, CAS, SEAD, and Strike missions, each with unique objectives and pacing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom Airspace Management Featuring simplified airspace control systems, including detailed departure, approach, and handover procedures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfect for Beginners and Intermediate Pilots Carefully balanced difficulty and pacing to support learning while staying immersive and exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Narrated and Animated Briefings Each mission starts with a lovingly crafted and voice-acted briefing to set the tone and provide all relevant details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-Game Music Radio Channel Enjoy curated synthwave and retro music during longer flights via a dedicated in-cockpit radio channel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 1000 Recorded Voice Lines Featuring a diverse cast of talented voice actors to bring immersion and atmosphere to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nearly 100 Pages of Documentation &amp; Kneeboards Extensive supporting material including background lore, procedures, maps, and detailed mission briefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Localization:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voiceovers: English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Briefings/Subtitles: English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795650?t=1750694880","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795650?t=1750694880","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795650/d09315e4120f8a1983f8092820b497cfce218865/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750694880","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795650/d09315e4120f8a1983f8092820b497cfce218865/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750694880","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"VR Support","id":31},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1985 - Following a sudden shift in Soviet leadership, the USSR abandoned d\u00e9tente and launched a full-scale invasion of Western Europe. West Germany fell within days, and most of the German Air Force was wiped out on the ground. Only a handful of squadrons managed to escape to Britain, regrouping for NATO\u2019s last stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Central Europe in flames, the Soviet war machine turned north. The Soviets goal: control of Scandinavia and the North Atlantic, cutting off NATO\u2019s supply lines and forcing the West into submission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a desperate bid to halt the advance, NATO formed the Task Force Northern Defenders\u2014a coalition of land, sea, and air units drawn from across the alliance. Among them, the remnants of the German Luftwaffe, hastily reformed and thrown into the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an F-4 Phantom pilot, you will engage in high-risk missions\u2014from air superiority to deep strikes and close air support\u2014fighting to hold the line and push the Soviets back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outnumbered. Outgunned. Not defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fate of Europe is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive &quot;Cold War Gone Hot&quot; Scenario Set in the icy landscapes of Northern Scandinavia during a fictional conflict in 1985.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_pa